# DNS / hosts example (authorized preservation lab only)
# Router dnsmasq:
#   address=/game-api.example.com/192.168.1.100
#
# Android hosts (root):
#   192.168.1.100  game-api.example.com
#   192.168.1.100  cdn.game.example.com
#
# Local adb reverse (same machine):
#   adb reverse tcp:8080 tcp:8080
#   adb reverse tcp:9000 tcp:9000
